{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "5b5965a9-9da7-886e-8ff8-8a5f8824284e",
  "created_at": "2026-01-12T18:28:36-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Zelia Gomes",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:26:20-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:26:24-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Kevin, Zelia Gomes. I know it's after hours for City Hall, but I figured this line would be picking up. I'm calling about water in my driveway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:26:35-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, we get the line in the evenings. Where are you calling from, Zelia?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:26:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "282 Old Beach Road, over by Easton's Beach."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:26:45-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 282 Old Beach Road. What's going on there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:26:49-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Since that coastal storm ended Saturday, the apron at the bottom of my driveway holds a puddle. It's wicked deep and it doesn't go anywhere. What it does is drain back toward my garage door."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:27:02-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the low spot at the end of the driveway is pooling and pitching toward the garage. Is it getting inside?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:27:11-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not yet, it's sitting right at the door. But it's also running down toward my neighbor's garage. Water's moving that way, slow but steady."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:27:21-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Water heading toward the neighbor's garage too. Do you know if there's a storm drain nearby that's clogged, or is it just the pavement?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:27:31-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't say for sure. There's a catch basin down the road a bit, but I can't see it from here. Can you tell me when somebody last came by to look at this street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:27:44-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me pull up the record for Old Beach Road. [pause] I'm not seeing a crew logged there since before the storm, so nothing recent that I can see."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:27:55-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. That's what I figured."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:27:58-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put in a request for a crew to check the drainage on your block, and I'll note the water going toward the neighbor's garage. Best number for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:28:09-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0159."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:28:10-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0159, perfect. Crews are stretched after the storm, so I can't give you a time, but it's in the queue tonight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:28:18-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Sorry if I sound distracted, I just lost a game of chess online. I play every night."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:28:26-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That'll do it. Anything else on the driveway?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:28:30-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's all. Thanks, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T18:28:33-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it. Take care, Zelia."
    }
  ],
